OL,5,G0600 Teleshopping
OL,6,     FShopping from Home.
OL,7,G0900 Africa From Above
OL,8,     FZambia: Fly above the far-western
OL,9,     Freaches of the Zambezi, experience
OL,10,     Fthe largest mammal migration on
OL,11,     Fearth, and explore Victoria Falls,
OL,12,     Fthe largest waterfall on the
OL,13,     Fplanet.
OL,14,G1000 Africa From Above
OL,15,     FMozambique: Explore palm-fringed
OL,16,     Fsands, parks and seafaring
OL,17,     Ftraditions, and discover the
OL,18,     Fmelting pot of African, Arabic and
OL,19,     FPortuguese traditions in one of
OL,20,     FAfrica's most enigmatic countries.
