OL,5,G1100 Africa From Above
OL,6,     FCameroon: Fly over the spectacular
OL,7,     Flandscapes of this sovereign
OL,8,     Fnation renowned for its diversity,
OL,9,     Ffrom the breathtaking coastal
OL,10,     Fregions on the Atlantic to the
OL,11,     Fshores of Lake Ossa.
OL,12,G1200 Africa From Above
OL,13,     FBotswana: Explore the landscapes
OL,14,     Fof Botswana, from the salt pans of
OL,15,     Fthe Makgadikgadi, over the maze of
OL,16,     Fmarshlands and floodplains of the
OL,17,     FOkavango Delta, to the Kalahari
OL,18,     Fdesert.
