OL,12,     FSan Francisco: Michael Portillo's
OL,13,     Fjourney's to San Francisco, where
OL,14,     Fhe travels through the city's
OL,15,     Fstreets by cable car, before
OL,16,     Fheading across the bay to
OL,17,     FSausalito.
